{
  "page": 567,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5332,
      "text": "Kemudian datang Fir'aun dan orang-orang yang sebelumnya dan (penduduk) negeri-negeri yang dijungkir balikkan karena kesalahan yang besar. [858]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5333,
      "text": "Maka mereka mendurhakai utusan Tuhannya, Allah menyiksa mereka dengan siksaan yang sangat keras.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5334,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya ketika air naik (sampai ke gunung), Kami membawa (nenek moyang) kamu[859] ke dalam kapal,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5335,
      "text": "agar Kami jadikan (peristiwa itu) sebagai peringatan bagi kamu dan agar diperhatikan oleh telinga yang mau mendengar.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5336,
      "text": "Maka apabila sangkakala ditiup sekali tiup,[860]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5337,
      "text": "dan diangkatlah bumi dan gunung-gunung, lalu dibenturkan keduanya sekali benturan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5338,
      "text": "Maka pada hari itu terjadilah hari Kiamat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5339,
      "text": "dan terbelahlah langit, karena pada hari itu langit menjadi rapuh.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5340,
      "text": "Dan para malaikat berada di berbagai penjuru langit. Pada hari itu delapan malaikat menjunjung Arasy (singgasana) Tuhanmu di atas (kepala) mereka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5341,
      "text": "Pada hari itu kamu dihadapkan (kepada Tuhanmu), tidak ada sesuatu pun dari kamu yang tersembunyi (bagi Allah).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5342,
      "text": "Adapun orang yang kitabnya[861] diberikan di tangan kanannya, maka dia berkata, \"Ambillah, bacalah kitabku (ini).\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5343,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya aku yakin, bahwa (suatu saat) aku akan menerima perhitungan terhadap diriku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5344,
      "text": "Maka orang itu berada dalam kehidupan yang diridai,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5345,
      "text": "dalam surga yang tinggi,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5346,
      "text": "buah-buahannya dekat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5347,
      "text": "(kepada mereka dikatakan), \"Makan dan minumlah dengan nikmat karena amal yang telah kamu kerjakan pada hari-hari yang telah lalu.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5348,
      "text": "Dan adapun orang yang kitabnya diberikan di tangan kirinya, maka dia berkata, \"Alangkah baiknya jika kitabku (ini) tidak diberikan kepadaku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5349,
      "text": "Sehingga aku tidak mengetahui bagaimana perhitunganku,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5350,
      "text": "Wahai, kiranya (kematian) itulah yang menyudahi segala sesuatu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5351,
      "text": "Hartaku sama sekali tidak berguna bagiku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5352,
      "text": "Kekuasaanku telah hilang dariku.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5353,
      "text": "(Allah berfirman), \"Tangkaplah dia lalu belenggulah tangannya ke lehernya.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5354,
      "text": "Kemudian masukkanlah dia ke dalam api neraka yang menyala-nyala.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5355,
      "text": "Kemudian belitlah dia dengan rantai yang panjangnya tujuh puluh hasta.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5356,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya dialah orang yang tidak beriman kepada Allah Yang Mahabesar.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5357,
      "text": "Dan juga dia tidak mendorong (orang lain) untuk memberi makan orang miskin.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
